    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Phantom Necro</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rule the dead. Summon the souls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Phantom Necro</i> is a strategic RPG set in a world where powerful factions collide.<br>Lead your own army as a necromancer and rise to claim the ultimate throne.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather souls to summon legendary phantoms and form squads that shake the battlefield.<br>Your choices and strategies will reshape the balance of power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Summoning System</strong><br>Collect souls and summon a variety of phantoms to build your own unique army.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718410/extras/b8e8d7532f82c1cc0659e8b4b4f360d2.poster.avif?t=1754015793\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718410/extras/b8e8d7532f82c1cc0659e8b4b4f360d2.webm?t=1754015793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718410/extras/b8e8d7532f82c1cc0659e8b4b4f360d2.mp4?t=1754015793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Squad System</strong><br>Strategy begins with formation. Assign phantoms to squads and seize control of the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718410/extras/cb42d1ec7b73636ffd1984032e33b1e8.poster.avif?t=1754015793\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718410/extras/cb42d1ec7b73636ffd1984032e33b1e8.webm?t=1754015793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718410/extras/cb42d1ec7b73636ffd1984032e33b1e8.mp4?t=1754015793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat</strong><br>You\u2019re part of the fight! Engage in real-time combat where both player and phantoms join forces on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718410/extras/2e76b83b81604efb55f0f3653178fddc.poster.avif?t=1754015793\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718410/extras/2e76b83b81604efb55f0f3653178fddc.webm?t=1754015793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718410/extras/2e76b83b81604efb55f0f3653178fddc.mp4?t=1754015793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heroes</strong><br>Mighty heroes will appear\u2014beings of overwhelming power.<br>Sometimes their target is you, other times your enemies.<br>Use every tactic\u2014from ambushes to head-on clashes\u2014to bring them down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718410/extras/c63f25a7782c7f25459f2817775ecc35.poster.avif?t=1754015793\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718410/extras/c63f25a7782c7f25459f2817775ecc35.webm?t=1754015793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718410/extras/c63f25a7782c7f25459f2817775ecc35.mp4?t=1754015793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Phantom Necro</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rule the dead. Summon the souls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Phantom Necro</i> is a strategic RPG set in a world where powerful factions collide.<br>Lead your own army as a necromancer and rise to claim the ultimate throne.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather souls to summon legendary phantoms and form squads that shake the battlefield.<br>Your choices and strategies will reshape the balance of power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Summoning System</strong><br>Collect souls and summon a variety of phantoms to build your own unique army.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718410/extras/b8e8d7532f82c1cc0659e8b4b4f360d2.poster.avif?t=1754015793\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718410/extras/b8e8d7532f82c1cc0659e8b4b4f360d2.webm?t=1754015793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718410/extras/b8e8d7532f82c1cc0659e8b4b4f360d2.mp4?t=1754015793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Squad System</strong><br>Strategy begins with formation. Assign phantoms to squads and seize control of the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718410/extras/cb42d1ec7b73636ffd1984032e33b1e8.poster.avif?t=1754015793\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718410/extras/cb42d1ec7b73636ffd1984032e33b1e8.webm?t=1754015793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718410/extras/cb42d1ec7b73636ffd1984032e33b1e8.mp4?t=1754015793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat</strong><br>You\u2019re part of the fight! Engage in real-time combat where both player and phantoms join forces on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718410/extras/2e76b83b81604efb55f0f3653178fddc.poster.avif?t=1754015793\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718410/extras/2e76b83b81604efb55f0f3653178fddc.webm?t=1754015793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718410/extras/2e76b83b81604efb55f0f3653178fddc.mp4?t=1754015793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heroes</strong><br>Mighty heroes will appear\u2014beings of overwhelming power.<br>Sometimes their target is you, other times your enemies.<br>Use every tactic\u2014from ambushes to head-on clashes\u2014to bring them down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718410/extras/c63f25a7782c7f25459f2817775ecc35.poster.avif?t=1754015793\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718410/extras/c63f25a7782c7f25459f2817775ecc35.webm?t=1754015793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718410/extras/c63f25a7782c7f25459f2817775ecc35.mp4?t=1754015793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "&quot;Phantom Necro&quot; is a strategic RPG about a necromancer who commands phantoms. Collect souls by defeating monsters and summon powerful creatures to fight by your side. Build your own faction in a world ruled by mighty powers and lead it to victory in an epic battle for supremacy.",
